  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assisted Voluntary Return and Reintegration Programme for International Protection Applicants and Other Migrant Groups in Finland (2024)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to support the Government of Finland&#x2019;s Assisted Voluntary Return and Reintegration policy by assisting up to 240 migrants willing to return voluntarily to their countries of origin and contributing to their sustainable reintegration. The assistance will consist of information provision through a multi-lingual counselling telephone line, return and reintegration counselling, assistance with travel preparation and documents, arranging international and domestic travel and assisting at departure, transit and arrival airport when requested. Reintegration assistance consists of delivering cash grants and providing in-kind assistance for supporting the returnees&#x2019; sustainable reintegration.</narrative>
  </description>
